# Word counter
***
The project creates a recisive triangle

## How to use the word counter
***
1. Running the code will instantly bring you to the menu.
2. pick which color and the amount of times it will reacure

## List of Key Features
***
-Allows you to change the color of it🤑

-Allows you slect the amount of recurision in the triangle! 🎉


